{
  "version": "shadowplay.story.v1",
  "title": "The Kind Crocodile",
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "kind-title",
      "type": "chapter",
      "chapter": "The Kind Crocodile",
      "text": "The Kind Crocodile"
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-lamp",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-hello",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "This is a story about a crocodile, {child|little one}. Don't worry. This one is very kind."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-mo",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "arriving"
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-river",
      "type": "scenery",
      "set": "river"
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-mo-rest",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": -0.4,
      "restV": 0.05
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-text",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Every night, Mo flies down to the river to say goodnight to her friends."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-want-fish",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "fish",
      "alt": "dog",
      "outlineU": 0,
      "outlineV": -0.18,
      "text": "Make a fish: a flat hand, fingers together, thumb tucked along the side."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-fish-yes",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "A little fish! It has lost its way home in the dark water."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-fish-ride",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "riding"
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-fish-carry",
      "type": "carry",
      "toU": 0.3,
      "text": "Swim, swim, follow the light."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-fish-land",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0.42,
      "restV": 0.04
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-fish-bows",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The fish finds its family, and they blow sleepy bubbles."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-dim1",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.8
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-croc-rest",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": -0.42,
      "restV": 0.05
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-croc-text",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Then the water ripples. Two eyes. A long, long smile."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-want-croc",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "crocodile",
      "text": "Make a crocodile: two flat hands, one on top of the other, like a long snappy mouth."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-croc-yes",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "It is the crocodile! Snap, snap. But the crocodile only wants to help."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-croc-ride",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "riding"
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-croc-carry",
      "type": "carry",
      "toU": 0.32,
      "text": "Ride across the river. Gently now."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-croc-land",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0.42,
      "restV": 0.05
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-croc-bows",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The crocodile sinks down, smiling, and closes its eyes."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-dim2",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.65
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-swan-rest",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": -0.42,
      "restV": 0.06
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-swan-text",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "On the far bank, a swan is waiting to tuck Mo in."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-want-swan",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "swan",
      "text": "Make a swan: a flat hand, bent down at the wrist, like a long neck and a beak."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-swan-yes",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "A swan, smooth and white, with a soft feather blanket."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-swan-ride",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "riding"
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-swan-carry",
      "type": "carry",
      "toU": 0.3,
      "text": "Glide home along the river."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-swan-land",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0.3,
      "restV": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-swan-bows",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The swan folds her neck and floats away into the reeds."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-home",
      "type": "scenery",
      "set": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-dim3",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-mo-centre",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0,
      "restV": 0.12
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-lesson",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Sometimes the ones who look the scariest have the kindest hearts."
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-finale",
      "type": "finale",
      "seconds": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "kind-goodnight",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Goodnight, river. Goodnight, kind crocodile. Goodnight, {child|little one}."
    },
